{"4455480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unbounded", "steam_appid": 4455480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unbounded is a top-down 2d roguelike bullet hell shooter all about dodging projectiles, fighting bosses, and surviving as long as possible.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455480/extras/fa36e467bef6165f9cb3c125fbb951c4.avif?t=1781044185\" width=718 height=401 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat bosses and pick upgrades you deem necessary for your weapon and current run. Each boss has a unique range of upgrades with modifiers that reflect their individual characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455480/extras/c748a585cddb497a007cc8f690672417.avif?t=1781044185\" width=925 height=519 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick wisely! Every upgrade matters as bosses progressively get stronger the more you defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access introduces 3 unique bosses, each with their own special terrain:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455480/extras/e0b6ec1b6ef22304bc53f646ed6a5a01.avif?t=1781044185\" width=1560 height=363 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More bosses, upgrades, and weapons to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455480/extras/5efca9b12250c36a87fc79e8c0d76088.poster.avif?t=1781044185\" width=454 height=256 >